sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant RBACProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS (service-ca)
    participant APIServer as KFP API Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant MariaDB as MariaDB<br/>3306/TCP MySQL
    participant S3 as S3 / MinIO<br/>9000/TCP HTTP
    participant Argo as Argo Workflow Controller
    participant TaskPod as Pipeline Task Pod
    participant PersistAgent as Persistence Agent
    participant Envoy as MLMD Envoy Proxy<br/>9090/TCP gRPC
    participant MLMD as MLMD gRPC Server<br/>8080/TCP gRPC

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,PersistAgent: Flow 1: Pipeline Run Execution
        User->>RBACProxy: POST pipeline run request<br/>HTTPS/8443, SubjectAccessReview
        RBACProxy->>APIServer: Forward request<br/>HTTP(S)/8888, pod-to-pod TLS
        APIServer->>MariaDB: Store pipeline run metadata<br/>MySQL/3306, TLS (service-ca)
        APIServer->>S3: Store pipeline artifacts<br/>HTTP(S)/9000, Access key auth
        APIServer->>Argo: Create Workflow CR<br/>K8s API, ServiceAccount
        Argo->>TaskPod: Create pipeline task pod<br/>K8s API, ServiceAccount
        TaskPod-->>Argo: Report task completion
        PersistAgent->>APIServer: Sync run state<br/>HTTP(S)/8888, pod-to-pod TLS
        APIServer-->>PersistAgent: Run state updates
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over TaskPod,MLMD: Flow 2: MLMD Metadata Access
        TaskPod->>Envoy: Store ML metadata<br/>gRPC/9090, TLS (service-ca)
        Envoy->>MLMD: Forward gRPC request<br/>gRPC/8080, mTLS (service-ca certs)
        MLMD->>MariaDB: Persist metadata<br/>MySQL/3306, TLS (service-ca)
        MariaDB-->>MLMD: Query results
        MLMD-->>Envoy: Metadata response
        Envoy-->>TaskPod: gRPC response
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over User,APIServer: Flow 3: Managed Pipeline Import
        participant DSPO as DSPO Operator
        participant OCIReg as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

        DSPO->>OCIReg: Fetch managed-pipelines.json<br/>HTTPS/443, Docker keychain auth
        OCIReg-->>DSPO: OCI image manifest + layers
        DSPO->>DSPO: Validate pipeline names against manifest
        Note over DSPO,APIServer: init-managed-pipelines container<br/>extracts pipelines to shared volume
        APIServer->>APIServer: Read /config/managed-pipelines
        APIServer->>MariaDB: Upload pipelines to DB<br/>MySQL/3306
    end
